-GC runs while holding the manager-home mutation lock. It marks build cache keys referenced by all valid marker v2 files and in-flight transaction journals, then sweeps unreferenced entries older than the normal grace period. If a marker cannot be parsed safely, GC retains potentially related entries and reports the uncertainty. It never uses receipt content alone as proof of a live consumer.
