scope:Read-only research across /Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/curator-spec at origin/main, /Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/curator at origin/main, and /Users/iv/Developer/Wildberries/cocoaskills at origin/main. Persist conclusions as a board outcome resource and, when broadly useful, under curator/.research/. Do not modify product/spec source files.
